+  "options": "<div class=\"cira-authority-form\"><h3>CONSENT TO USE AND DISCLOSE CREDIT INFORMATION</h3><p><b>For use of individuals (including directors, partners and trustees)</b></p><p><b>To:</b> Comfort Home Furnishing Pte Limited trading as Flexible Purchase, 18 Yarawa Road, Nabua, Suva.</p><p><b>1. I consent to Flexible Purchase:</b></p><ol><li>Providing information about me to any credit reporting agency licensed under the Fair Reporting of Credit Act 2016.</li><li>Obtaining information about me, typically as a credit report, from a Credit Reporting Agency and using that information in relation to products and services Flexible Purchase may provide to me; another person or entity for which I am a guarantor; or an entity with which I am connected, including as a director, partner or trustee.</li><li>Holding, processing and storing that information, including any credit report, and this consent through actual, electronic or virtual data storage.</li></ol><p><b>2. I consent to a Credit Reporting Agency:</b></p><ol><li>Collecting information about me from Flexible Purchase; and</li><li>Disclosing information about me, typically as a credit report, to Flexible Purchase.</li></ol><p>This consent applies to all credit products and services Flexible Purchase may provide to me or to the other persons or entities referred to above.</p><p>I acknowledge that this has been explained to me and that I understand why my consent is being obtained, and that I can access and request correction of information held in a Credit Reporting Agency database by the Agency or Flexible Purchase at any time.</p></div>",
